#: src/postulo/templates/help/contact_block.html:12
#, draft
msgid ""
"<em>Headline</em> is a short professional title, such as “Backend engineer”. A CV that has a headline of its own prints that one instead."
msgstr ""
"Is teideal gairmiúil gearr é an <em>Ceannteideal</em>, mar shampla “Innealtóir cúil”. Má tá ceannteideal dá chuid féin ag CV, clóscríobhann sé sin ina ionad."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/identifiers.html:15
#, draft
msgid ""
"<em>Kind</em> is the register the identifier belongs to, and <em>What goes where</em> shows what each one looks like. <em>Other</em> takes anything else, with a name you give it."
msgstr ""
"Is é an <em>Cineál</em> an clárlann ar leis an aitheantóir é, agus léiríonn <em>Cad a théann cá</em> cén chuma atá ar gach ceann. Glacann <em>Eile</em> le haon rud eile, le hainm a thugann tú air."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/telephone_numbers.html:11
#, draft
msgid ""
"<em>Kind</em> says what the number is, and can be left blank. Choose <em>Other</em> and a box asks what to call it."
msgstr ""
"Deir <em>Cineál</em> cad is uimhir ann, agus is féidir é a fhágáil bán. Roghnaigh <em>Eile</em> agus fiafraíonn bosca cad ba cheart a thabhairt air."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/contact_block.html:27
#, draft
msgid ""
"<em>Language of your career record</em> says which language your experience, education and projects are typed in. A CV in another language shows what you have translated and says what it could not. It also decides which forms of address and pronouns the menus of <em>Your name</em> offer. Left as it is, it follows the language you read Postulo in."
msgstr ""
"Deir <em>Teanga do thaifid ghairme</em> cén teanga ina bhfuil do thaithí, d’oideachas agus do thionscadail clóscríofa. Taispeánann CV i dteanga eile an méid a d’aistrigh tú agus deir sé cad nach bhféadfadh sé a aistriú. Socraíonn sé freisin cé na bealaí labhartha agus forainmneacha a thairgeann roghchláir <em>D’ainm</em>. Má fhágtar mar atá é, leanann sé an teanga ina léann tú Postulo."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/contact_block.html:18
#, draft
msgid ""
"<em>Location</em> is where you are, as a document should print it. Left blank, your documents print the town and country of your primary postal address, never the street, and the box shows that line in grey. The blank is what is kept, so making another address the primary changes what is printed without this page being saved again. Type something and that is printed instead."
msgstr ""
"Is é <em>Suíomh</em> an áit a bhfuil tú, mar ba cheart do cháipéis é a chlóscríobh. Má fhágtar bán é, clóscríobhann do cháipéisí baile agus tír do phríomhsheolta poist, riamh an tsráid, agus taispeánann an bosca an líne sin i liath. Is é an folmhú an rud a choinnítear, mar sin athraíonn seoladh eile a dhéanamh ina phríomhsheoladh an méid a chlóscríobhtar gan an leathanach seo a shábháil arís. Clóscríobh rud éigin agus clóscríobhtar é sin ina ionad."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/links.html:21
#, draft
msgid ""
"<em>Other</em> takes any web address, and a name to show for it; left blank, the name is the address's host. A card with no <em>Service</em> menu takes any address in the same way. Under a named service a row has no name of its own: the service is its name."
msgstr ""
"Glacann <em>Eile</em> le haon seoladh gréasáin, agus ainm le taispeáint dó; má fhágtar bán é, is é óstríomhaire an tseolta an t-ainm. Glacann cárta gan roghchlár <em>Seirbhís</em> le haon seoladh ar an gcaoi chéanna. Faoi sheirbhís ainmnithe níl ainm dá chuid féin ag sraith: is í an tseirbhís a hainm."

