#: src/postulo/templates/server/capture.html:66
#, draft
msgid ""
"A capture keeps what it read and throws the page away. It can keep the page as well: the source as it was parsed, and a rendering of the whole page. Both are off until you switch them on, because keeping a copy of somebody else's page is a decision to make on purpose. Each person then switches them on for their own captures; what is off here is off for everybody."
msgstr ""
"Coinníonn gabháil an méid a léigh sí agus caitheann sí an leathanach uaithi. Is féidir léi an leathanach a choinneáil freisin: an fhoinse mar a parsáladh í, agus rindreáil den leathanach iomlán. Tá an dá cheann as go dtí go gcuireann tú air iad, mar gur cinneadh é cóip de leathanach duine eile a choinneáil a dhéantar d’aon ghnó. Cuireann gach duine air iad ansin dá ngabhálacha féin; an méid atá as anseo, tá sé as do chách."

