#: src/postulo/templates/server/plugins.html:27
#, draft
msgid ""
"A plugin's own file is checked against the checksum its catalogue signed. Its requirements are not: those are fetched from PyPI when it is installed, and are whatever is served that day. Trusting a plugin means trusting its list of requirements too. Postulo installs only built wheels, never a source package that would run its own code while installing, and records everything that arrived."
msgstr ""
"Seiceáiltear comhad an bhreiseáin féin i gcoinne na suime seiceála a shínigh a chatalóg. Ní sheiceáiltear a chuid riachtanas: faightear iad sin ó PyPI nuair a shuiteáiltear é, agus is iad an rud a fhreastalaítear an lá sin. Ciallaíonn muinín a chur i mbreiseán muinín a chur ina liosta riachtanas freisin. Ní shuiteálann Postulo ach pacáistí tógtha (wheels), riamh pacáiste foinseach a rithfeadh a chód féin le linn suiteála, agus coinníonn sé taifead ar gach ar tháinig."

