#: src/postulo/templates/server/design.html:416
#, draft
msgid ""
"Comfortable is the default. Compact tightens the room around cards and inside tables, and nothing else — a preference cannot cost a criterion, so what you can click stays the size it was. Choose it under Settings → Appearance; this page shows whichever you are reading it in."
msgstr ""
"Is é compordach an réamhshocrú. Teannann dlúth an spás thart ar chártaí agus laistigh de tháblaí, agus aon rud eile ní dhéanann sé: ní féidir le sainroghanna critéar a chostas, mar sin fanann an méid is féidir leat a chliceáil ar an méid a bhí sé. Roghnaigh é faoi Socruithe → Cuma; taispeánann an leathanach seo cibé ceann ina bhfuil tú á léamh."

