msgid ""
"Prometheus metrics are served at <code>/metrics</code> with no token, so anybody who can reach this instance can read them. They carry counts only — how many applications exist, not whose — and nothing that names a person, a company or an application, which is why this is a reasonable thing to leave open on a private network. Set POSTULO_METRICS_TOKEN if it is not."
msgstr ""
"Freastalaítear ar mhéadrachtaí Prometheus ag <code>/metrics</code> gan chomhartha, mar sin is féidir le duine ar bith a shroicheann an t-ásc seo iad a léamh. Níl iontu ach comhairimh — cé mhéad iarratas atá ann, ní cé leo — agus faic a ainmníonn duine, cuideachta nó iarratas, agus is é sin an fáth gur réasúnta iad a fhágáil oscailte ar líonra príobháideach. Socraigh POSTULO_METRICS_TOKEN mura amhlaidh atá."

