"Somebody arriving through this provider is signed in as the account holding the address it gives, so long as the provider says that address is verified. That makes one question worth answering: does this provider only call an address verified when the person proved they hold it? If you run it, almost certainly. If it is somebody else's, check before you rely on it. Set POSTULO_OIDC_LINK_BY_EMAIL to false to require each person to sign in here once and connect the provider from their own account page."
msgstr ""
"Duine a thagann tríd an soláthraí seo, sínítear isteach é sa chuntas ar leis an seoladh a thugtar, chomh fada is a deir an soláthraí go bhfuil an seoladh fíoraithe. Is fiú ceist amháin a fhreagairt mar sin: an nglaonn an soláthraí seo seoladh fíoraithe air ach amháin nuair a chruthaigh an duine gur leis é? Má ritheann tú féin é, is dócha go láidir. Más le duine eile é, seiceáil sula mbraitheann tú air. Socraigh POSTULO_OIDC_LINK_BY_EMAIL go false chun a éileamh go sínigh gach duine isteach anseo uair amháin agus go gceanglóidh siad an soláthraí óna leathanach cuntais féin."

